ok - a task record matches its own live pane, bound or legacy
ok - repro: after a restart Herdr reissued pane w2:p2 to an unrelated terminal
ok - repro: read by pane id alone, the finished task record names a live agent
ok - liveness, existence, capture, steering, interrupt, and cleanup all treat the reissued pane as the finished task endpoint gone, and leave it untouched
ok - passive visible reads refuse the reissued pane for the finished record (bound and legacy) and still work for the owning record
